'''Morgan''' (Japanese: '''ルミタン''' ''Lematin'') is one of the four {{tc|Battle Chatelaine|leaders}} of the [[Battle Maison]] in [[Pokémon X and Y|Pokémon X, Y]], [[Pokémon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire|Omega Ruby, and Alpha Sapphire]], alongside her sisters [[Nita]], [[Evelyn]], and [[Dana]].

==In the core series games==
Morgan is the leader of the [[Rotation Battle]] format of the [[Battle Maison]], as well as the eldest of the {{tc|Battle Chatelaine}} sisters. Morgan can be battled once the {{player}} has acquired a 19-win streak. She can later be battled on the Super Rotation Battle once the player has acquired a 49-win streak.

Morgan may also appear alongside [[Evelyn]] in the [[Multi Battle]] format after the player as attained a 19-win streak. She will randomly send out two of the four Pokémon  from her Rotation Battle team. In the Super Multi Battle format, Morgan may be battled alongside [[Nita]] after the player has reached a 49-win streak. She will randomly send out two of the four Pokémon from her Super Rotation Battle team. 

